DATABASE_URL="postgresql://firefliuser:strongpassword@localhost:5432/fflidb" - Your connection string (e.g. hosted on Supabase, Railway, Neon, etc.)
SESSION_SECRET="" - A strong secret string (e.g. generated via openssl rand -base64 32)
ENCRYPTION_KEY="" - Encrypt your Discord intergration (e.g. generated via openssl rand -base64 64)
NEXTAUTH_URL="" - Your Domain/Connection URL (e.g. https://domain.domain.com - no / at end.)
CRON_SECRET="" - Protects the scheduled jobs in /api/cron (e.g. generated via openssl rand -base64 32). Vercel sends it automatically to its cron jobs.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN="" - Vercel Blob token for moderation evidence. Added automatically when you connect a Blob store on Vercel. Leave empty to store files on disk.
STALE_SESSION_HOURS="6" - Optional. On Vercel, activity sessions open longer than this are closed automatically.
